%% plan.mmd — phase-shaped moving-precursor capture: planning + execution sequence, and the mode state machine.

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Ref as HandoffReference (q*,qvel*,tau*)
    participant Q as QuinticSegment
    participant Cap as PhaseShapeCapture
    participant CEM as structured CEM planner
    participant Down as Frozen downstream

    Note over Ref,Down: REFRAMING — cradle handoff is a phase-point of a MOVING orbit (q=pos, qvel=tangent, tau=history)
    Ref->>Ref: from_cradle -> (q*, qvel*, tau*); precursor q_pre(dt) = q* - dt*qvel*
    Note over Q,Cap: OFFLINE PLAN (deterministic per seed, no state edit)
    CEM->>Cap: sample bounded params (dt, s, preload_start, bmax, 2 residual knots)
    Cap->>Q: quintic READY -> q_pre, terminal velocity s*qvel*
    Cap->>Cap: track quintic (governed servo) + residual
    Cap->>Cap: ramp prev_tau -> tau* DURING the moving segment (not after — post-hoc accelerates out of tube)
    Cap->>Down: terminal moving snapshot
    Down-->>CEM: strict K6? min_dtz, safe
    CEM->>CEM: elite-refit; stop on first K6

    Note over Cap,Down: verdicts
    Cap-->>CEM: MOVING_PRECAPTURE_TO_HANDOFF (1 seed K6)
    CEM-->>CEM: HOME_V1_TO_DYNAMIC_HANDOFF_REACHABILITY (>=3 independent seeds K6, deterministic, traces saved)

